+Measured context: recorded turn latency is p50 ~18.5s / p95 ~68.6s (`eval-output/live-summary.zai-org-glm-5.3-flash.json`), and `docs/useful-brain-execution-tracker.md:411` records ~15.6s p50 / ~56s p95 against a 15s p95 budget. The dominant cost is model roundtrips, and the app never streams any of it. Retrieval is a smaller but fully serial chain that repeats per search. Non-chat wins: a per-upload full-corpus re-embed, and a ~2× full-corpus refetch on workspace navigation. Highest-confidence items are code-visible mechanics; three items are marked low confidence where platform behavior is unverified.
